WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.486 --> 00:00:03.411
打开Settings / Open Settings

2
00:00:03.411 --> 00:00:06.343
进入Privacy分组 / Open the Privacy section

3
00:00:06.343 --> 00:00:09.249
离开Settings进入Composer / Leave Settings for Composer

4
00:00:09.249 --> 00:00:12.169
返回Settings保留Privacy / Return to Settings with Privacy retained

5
00:00:12.169 --> 00:00:15.151
切到Diagnostics / Switch to Diagnostics

6
00:00:15.151 --> 00:00:18.100
再次返回仍是Privacy / Return again to the retained Privacy section

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.016
返回Capture / Return to Capture

8
00:00:21.016 --> 00:00:23.935
打开未配置的Agent面板 / Open the unconfigured Agent panel

9
00:00:23.935 --> 00:00:27.087
从空态进入Agent设置 / Follow Configure from the empty state

10
00:00:27.087 --> 00:00:30.076
返回Capture并保持Agent打开 / Return to Capture with Agent open

11
00:00:30.076 --> 00:00:33.006
打开rules仍保留Agent / Open rules while retaining Agent

12
00:00:33.006 --> 00:00:35.927
打开composer仍保留Agent / Open composer while retaining Agent

13
00:00:35.927 --> 00:00:38.938
打开diagnostics仍保留Agent / Open diagnostics while retaining Agent

14
00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:41.903
用Header入口关闭Agent / Close Agent with the Header control

15
00:00:41.903 --> 00:00:44.901
用Header入口重新打开 / Reopen with the Header control

16
00:00:44.901 --> 00:00:47.866
用面板自己的关闭按钮 / Use the panel’s own close button

17
00:00:47.866 --> 00:00:50.941
只打开Theme菜单检查选择 / Open Theme without changing the selection

18
00:00:50.941 --> 00:00:54.219
Escape关闭且主题不变 / Dismiss with Escape and retain the theme

19
00:00:54.219 --> 00:00:57.422
缩小实际App窗口 / Resize the actual App window smaller

20
00:00:57.422 --> 00:01:00.605
恢复原窗口尺寸 / Restore the original window size

21
00:01:00.605 --> 00:01:03.545
返回Capture查看快捷入口 / Return to Capture for its shortcut

22
00:01:03.545 --> 00:01:06.505
打开底栏上游快捷浮层 / Open the statusbar Upstream shortcut

23
00:01:06.505 --> 00:01:09.454
从浮层直达Upstream设置 / Open Upstream settings from the popover

24
00:01:09.454 --> 00:01:12.368
离开深链目标 / Leave the deep-link destination

25
00:01:12.368 --> 00:01:15.333
返回Settings保留新的Upstream位置 / Return to Settings with Upstream retained

26
00:01:15.333 --> 00:01:18.273
回到Capture确认Recording / Return to Capture and confirm Recording

27
00:01:18.273 --> 00:01:21.122
验证导航后的请求 / Verify a request after navigation
